  "schematicNotes": [
    {
      "id": "n1",
      "schematicPosition": {
        "x": 390,
        "y": 2400
      },
      "text": "TrackCluster Assembly — created 2026-09-25 (Cowork). J8 pinout SoT: center-cluster-esp32-p4/PINOUT.md + docs/datasheets/waveshare-esp32-p4-xc-j8-silkscreen.png. CAN H/L is NOT drawn here: owned by st185-link-ecu-config ST185-CAN.harness (cluster drop T1). Flash center board via 'USB TO UART' port only (Enc3 on GPIO24/25). No in-pod disconnects (decision 2026-09-25): 22 AWG, generic 2.54 housings. Side-board 5V as installed.",
      "width": 390
    }
  ],
